OL,3,GNEWSAMan sentenced after NI's biggest
OL,4,Acocaine seizure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old county Armagh man has
OL,7,Freceived a six year sentence for his
OL,8,Frole in what police said was the
OL,9,Flargest ever seizure of cocaine in
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland.
OL,12,FCiaran McBride, of Listrakelt Road,
OL,13,FDerrynoose, was arrested in December
OL,14,F2023 after officers found cocaine with
OL,15,Fan estimated street value of #12m in
OL,16,FJonesborough, County Armagh.
OL,18,FThe drugs were discovered under a false
OL,19,Ffloor in a frozen meat truck.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,414,410,260,120,0,100
